                <td \n                  width=\"160\"\n                  valign=\"top\"\n                  style=\"\n                    padding:14px;\n                    background-color:#4586a6;\n                    color:#ffffff;\n                    font-weight:bold;\n                    border:1px solid #dcdcdc;\n                    font-size:15px;\">\n                  Mensaje\n                </td>\n\n                <td \n                  style=\"\n                    padding:14px;\n                    background-color:#ffffff;\n                    color:#333333;\n                    border:1px solid #dcdcdc;\n                    font-size:15px;\n                    line-height:1.7;\">\n                  <b>Modern Antivirus Software for Better Device Security</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nProtecting a computer from malware has become essential for anyone who browses websites, downloads files, shops online, or uses digital banking. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nReal-time threat detection can help prevent harmful software from stealing passwords, damaging files, or affecting device performance. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAdditional information about antivirus security is available through <a href=https://shieldgardia.com/>antivirus for online banking and shopping</a>. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Understanding the Need for Antivirus Protection</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nMalware can be distributed through infected email attachments, compromised websites, misleading advertisements, fake updates, and unsafe applications. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nWhile ransomware may make important files inaccessible, spyware can operate quietly and collect confidential information. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAn active antivirus engine can analyze new files and block known threats before they are allowed to run. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Digital Threats Found on Modern Devices</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<list> <br />\r\n<>] Traditional computer viruses and malicious files <br />\r\n<>] Ransomware and unauthorized data encryption <br />\r\n<>] Programs created to collect sensitive information <br />\r\n<>] Trojans disguised as legitimate software <br />\r\n<>] Fraudulent websites created to steal account credentials <br />\r\n<>] Potentially unwanted applications <br />\r\n<>] Infected documents, archives, installers, and attachments <br />\r\n</list> <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Essential Antivirus Features</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nGood antivirus software should operate quietly in the background while maintaining continuous protection. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nActive file monitoring allows security software to respond immediately when suspicious content reaches a device. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAutomatic security updates are equally important because new malware variants appear regularly. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nUseful antivirus functions can include: <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<list> <br />\r\n<>] Real-time malware detection <br />\r\n<>] Automatic and on-demand device scanning <br />\r\n<>] Protection against phishing websites <br />\r\n<>] Automatic security database updates <br />\r\n<>] Safe isolation of potentially harmful content <br />\r\n<>] Monitoring for ransomware-related behavior <br />\r\n</list> <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Security for Browsing, Banking, and Shopping</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nEveryday activities such as online banking, shopping, messaging, and file sharing can expose users to digital risks. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAntivirus protection can help identify known phishing pages and websites associated with harmful downloads. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nBefore submitting sensitive information, users should confirm that the website is genuine and the connection is secure. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Antivirus Protection for Home and Business</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nUsers frequently keep sensitive files, login details, business records, and private messages on their devices. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nMalware affecting a company device may result in data loss, account compromise, downtime, or financial damage. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nA complete security approach should include both protective software and careful user behavior. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Simple Ways to Improve Device Security</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nInstall operating system and application updates as soon as practical. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAvoid reusing passwords and activate two-step verification whenever it is available. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nStore backup copies of valuable files in both offline and trusted remote locations. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nCarefully review the source of every program before downloading or installing it. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<b>Choose Better Protection for Your Digital Life</b> <br />\r\n <br />\r\nAlthough no antivirus can guarantee absolute security, active malware protection can reduce exposure to many common online threats. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nThe strongest approach combines updated antivirus software, current applications, secure passwords, regular backups, and careful online behavior. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nDiscover available options for improving your digital protection with <a href=https://shieldgardia.com/>how to remove spyware</a>.                </td>\n              </tr>\n\n            </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#f9f9f9;padding:30px 40px;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;\">\n\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">\n              Este es un correo automático generado desde el formulario de contacto.\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">\n              Todos los derechos reservados.\n            </p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin:0;\">\n              <a \n                href=\"https://visana.com.co/\"\n                target=\"_blank\"\n                style=\"color:#4586a6;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;\">\n\n                Visana\n\n              </a> &copy; 2026            </p>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>', 'sent', '', '2026-08-22 20:02:28');
